      "statement": "If \\(a_n\\ge0\\), \\(a_{n+1}\\le a_n\\) for every \\(n\\), and \\(a_n\\to0\\), then \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^n a_n\\) converges.",
